<x:xmpmeta xmlns:x="adobe:ns:meta/">
  <rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#">
    <rdf:Description xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" rdf:about="">
      <dc:title>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Do Not Forget</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;The memory of Angellaâ€™s last moments, her sacrifice, haunted Adora. She had never been able to share Angellaâ€™s exact last words with anyone, not even with Bowâ€”how Angella had told her to look after everyone.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Everyone was overjoyed to hear that rescuing Angella was possible. Adora shared that joy, of course, but did not know how she would face the Queen. How could she tell Angella that, once again, she had failed?&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
      <dc:creator>
        <rdf:Seq>
          <rdf:li>Paganaidd</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Seq>
